====== Ubiquiti LiteBeam 5AC Gen2======

Ubiquiti LiteBeam 5AC Gen2 (LBE-5AC-Gen2) is a dual band outdoor PoE CPE packed inside feedhorn that attaches to small directional reflector included in the package. airOS utilizes 2.4GHz wifi as a management radio only, thus it's performance and range are less than 5GHz wifi.

{{media:ubiquiti:ubnt-lbe-5ac-gen2.jpg?200|LiteBeam 5AC Gen2}}

