===== Installation via U-Boot, TFTP and serial console =====
/* Source: [[https://git.openwrt.org/?p=openwrt/openwrt.git;a=commit;h=157e17e985ea494f7f0a870df0afa0a837eccb8c|git commit that added support for LBE-5AC-Gen2]] */

* with newer devices, and bigger images, you might get a LZMA error during bootm. If it happens, try using 0x82000000 in tftpboot and bootm.

  - Configure your TFTP server with IP 192.168.1.254
  - Connect serial console and power up the device
  - Hit any key to stop autoboot
  - ''tftpboot 0x81000000 openwrt-ath79-generic-ubnt_litebeam-ac-gen2-initramfs-kernel.bin''
  - ''bootm 0x81000000''
  - copy ''openwrt-ath79-generic-ubnt_litebeam-ac-gen2-squashfs-sysupgrade.bin'' to /tmp
  - ''sysupgrade /tmp/openwrt-ath79-generic-ubnt_litebeam-ac-gen2-squashfs-sysupgrade.bin''


